---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Contact" description="Contact Bump Compass — errors, sources, suggestions.">
  <section class="section section-white">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="prose">
    <h1>Contact — Bump Compass</h1>

    <p>We read every message. We cannot provide medical advice, and we will not try.</p>

    <h2>What we can help with</h2>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>Errors</strong> — a tool giving a wrong result, a broken calculation, a page that does not load</li>
      <li><strong>Sources</strong> — a citation that is outdated, a claim that needs a better authority, a disagreement between sources we should surface</li>
      <li><strong>Suggestions</strong> — a tool you wish existed, a guide you wish we had written</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What we cannot help with</h2>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>Medical questions</strong> — if you are pregnant, postpartum, or concerned about your baby, please contact your own clinician. We are not a clinic and we do not provide medical advice.</li>
      <li><strong>Product complaints</strong> — if you have an issue with a product you purchased, contact the retailer or manufacturer directly.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How to reach us</h2>

    <p><strong>Email:</strong> [redacted — set up a contact form or email address before launch]</p>

    <p>Please include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>The page URL</li>
      <li>What you expected to see</li>
      <li>What you actually saw</li>
    </ul>

    <p>We aim to respond within 3 business days.</p>

    <p><em>This contact form is for site feedback only. It is not monitored for medical emergencies. If you are experiencing a medical emergency, call 911 (US) or 999 (UK).</em></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
